{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XcGpcYMevr989magHzqMYA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:42.819313+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XcGpcYMevr989magHzqMYA","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/rdcp36XiccnXEED97ib1GvOP68cF8dEtFbcceiaFQXxvZrovTv0qzQJVohKZMYQHc86rrXlJaiaFhMrJ39RJbxM485oVMGnIp7hAbC3lukEK3CQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><b><span>如果你对星辰大海充满向往，</span></b><b><span>如果你想近距离接触“奋斗者”号全海深载人潜水器，如果你想探究深渊的奥秘....</span></b><b><span><br/></span></b></p><p><b><span>那么，这个夏天，中国科学院</span><b><span>深海科学与工程研究</span></b><span>所邀你一起，</span></b><b><span>逐梦深蓝，挺进深海！</span></b></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/rdcp36XiccnVnSbiaTSdJJGjUavTAUXc4RXyg0hXXDtBKlsgQtwp74VN25nlDza09S8YaF04TUXwj4tTX0IlbcibkpiaWhZebmNrHuYx7x3hichw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><b><span><br/></span></b></p></section></section><p><span><span>Part 1</span></span></p><hr/><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>“走向深蓝”</span></span><b><span><span>夏令营</span></span></b></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>—</span></span></span><span><span>—</span></span><span><span><span>—</span></span><span><span><span><span>—</span></span></span><span><span>—</span></span><span><span><span><span><span>—</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span><span>📅</span></span><span><span>活动时间及形式</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>活动时间：</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>月中旬（预计</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>14</span></span></span><span><span>日-</span></span><span><span><span>17</span></span></span><span><span>日，如有变动另行通知）</span></span></p><p><span><span>预计招收人数：</span></span><span><span><span>30-40</span></span></span><span><span>人。</span></span></p><p><span><span>活动形式：线下</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>🌟</span></span><span><span>活动主要内容</span></span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>参观研究所相关实验室和科普基地：包括工程实验室、生物和地质实验室、鲸豚标本馆；进入实验室参观、学习及体验。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>观看科考航次视频，体验</span></span><span><span><span>VR</span></span></span><span><span>虚拟现实实验室。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span>参观探索号科考船和载人潜水器。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span>与科学家对话，了解心仪导师的研究领域。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>📝申请要求</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.招收对象和要求：有意报考深海所的全国高校大三在校本</span></span><span><span>科生（即2027年应届毕业生），专业为海洋科学类、海洋生物、海洋地质、电子、通信工程、机械工程及相关学科专业。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.学习成绩优秀，在学期间无重修或补考记录，原则上学习成绩排名在本专业前15%，无违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.英语能力要求（满足以下一条即可）：英语四级成绩在425分以上，通过英语六级者优先考虑；雅思成绩6.0分以上；托福成绩85分以上（雅思、托福成绩需在有效期内）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.对我所研究方向有浓厚兴趣，并有较强的研究能力。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>🚀报名方式</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.网上报名：报名网址：http://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn/login/index/sc 。请务必阅读填报说明，完成用户注册。登录后选80188-中国科学院深海科学与工程研究所“走向深海”大学生夏令营，并继续完成后续报名内容。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.报名材料：申请报名阶段无需邮寄纸质材料，以PDF形式发送材料至邮箱：yjs@idsse.ac.cn，邮件主题：2026年夏令营+学校+专业+姓名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）《中国科学院大学2026年大学生夏令营申请表》（系统提交报名后自动生成，在排名处需加盖学院公章）打印，需有学院负责人签字，扫描为PDF文件。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）本科成绩单扫描件、专业（或年级）排名证明（需加盖学院及校教务主管部门公章）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）三封推荐信（其中两封须为副教授及以上职称的专家书写，第三封为辅导员或者班主任书写，格式体例不限）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）大学英语考试证书、或TOEFL成绩证明1份、或IELTS成绩证明1份。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（5）提交体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果、各类奖项、证书等材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>注：以上内容按照顺序合并成一个PDF文件，文件名和主题名一致。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.网上报名、提交材料截止时间：2026年6月25（系统报名和电子材料需要同时审核，请勿超过截止时间提交材料）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.资格审核：研究所在6月30日前完成报名资格审核，申请者可通过报名系统查询申请是否通过。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.学生信息确认时间：通过审核者须在7月2日10点前登录报名系统确定是否同意参加，超过时限将视为自动放弃。</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.研究所将公布最终录取名单，后续如需来所报到需携带纸质材料，具体事宜将另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>📍其他事项</span></span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>参加夏令营的学生必须遵守我所的相关规定，按照统一的安排进行工作和活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>所有营员在营期间研究所将免费安排食宿，统一为学员购买人身意外伤害险。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span>凭票报销单程城际间来营路费，区间应为学校、家庭所在地或实验实习地</span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span>需学校开具证明</span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span><span><span>到研究所，路费报销标准及报销凭证规定将在后续通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span>如遇恶劣天气及其他不可抗力情况，举办时间及方式可能会做部分调整，请关注后续通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>☎️联系我们</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：段老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：海南省三亚市吉阳区鹿回头路</span></span><span><span><span>28</span></span></span><span><span>号</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮编：</span></span><span><span><span>572000</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>网址：</span></span><span><span><span>http://www.idsse.ac.cn</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span></span><span><span><span>0898-88231178</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>Email</span></span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span>yjs@idsse.ac.cn</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>Part 2</span></span></p><hr/><section><section><section><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>关于深海所</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>—</span></span></span><span><span>—</span></span><span><span><span>—</span></span><span><span><span><span><span>—</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><b><span><span>中国科学院深海科学与工程研究所</span></span></b><span><span>（简称：深海所）位于美丽的碧海蓝天之城——</span></span><b><span><span>海南三亚</span></span></b><span><span>。这里是我国深海科学研究与工程技术研发的最前沿，拥有先进的科考船队和实验室集群，带你触达海沟深渊。</span></span><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>🏠</span></span><span><span>设施环境</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/rdcp36XiccnWxeNAEuhqW0vmwfoteEMcRXJhibXEwF9picb0Y5cVmIPicIFRTzTrSIRw5ZWTla8JfK7pFIvpZCIYC27xYELFIxY4rBC1SptYqpw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>（深海所科研园区全览）</span></span></section><section><span>深海所科研园区坐落于鹿回头半岛区域，紧邻三亚湾，自然环境极佳，办公室内即可观赏到碧海蓝天、椰林白沙的热带风光。</span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/rdcp36XiccnWceTGzxcc4UOeUgxFe6hPmtw7oBOWzAXXiawx16iaxILpAMvLhLYWeDhq2wbQ4OMXicNfL3dg4nhU0A9pZrtI6MJU9DO5IqW1ZIc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>（综合楼办公室外景，拍摄于九楼图书馆）</span></span></section><section><span>所内设立了“深海空间”，兼具图书馆、活动室、艺术画廊功能，定期与央美开展海洋主题艺术作品创作与展览。</span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/rdcp36XiccnUVXkJJXQOMZiclxfpPdjoNy17uL0IgD0iaKZfsKeRAxMCgoH5t64UwRibZXrxTBPKAZrX9va6r0lDfX96lRqqPb0ZA6s4Ve061BU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>（“深海空间”海景图书馆）</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span><section><section><p><span><span>🔬科研装备</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/rdcp36XiccnVFo0usAYDib3Cvdn0AFFDX5r7uGRStd7TicYbFcmsESWRrrzibbNPPyLY1ibvapIduKUZFmU22ibVE0qQEdwAzJSTib2RkxCBGcibRCk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span alt=\"\" title=\"\"><span>（探索系列科考船及“奋斗者”号、“深海勇士”号载人深潜器）</span></span></p><p><span>研究所运行着“探索一号”、“探索二号”、“探索三号”三艘载人深潜科考母船以及“奋斗者”号、“深海勇士”号载人深潜器等先进的深海科考装备。无论是冰雪覆盖的极地，还是黑暗神秘的深渊海沟</span><span>，都变得触手可及。</span></p><p><span>世界最先进的全海深载人潜水器、黑暗深渊下的奇异生物、静静沉睡海底滋养万物的鲸落、沉船上的宝藏，等你来一起探秘！</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>🏨生活及休闲设施</span></span><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/rdcp36XiccnVzju90DK0ia9FRb3jvYbiaLG32Rbyvq3ictsU0kiakqnDtxqszQX9SWzYJfUCo4fvlLxdZr7DOLib7pX1gG375PTM44SVb9dspCprU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>（研究生公寓，部分设施为自行购买）</span></span></p><section><span>不仅科研设施“硬核”，生活设施也不含糊。研究生公寓位于生活园区，公寓为单人单间，拥有独立卫浴和开放阳台。“单人公寓”、“海景阳台”就等你入住！</span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/rdcp36XiccnWfnogVRxjPIL7CKBaEiaRvcd2EuM5kkTf7wKyESmrSicRzBHmlmLviccdNKRUMZ4EGIqiaFLNuHEdI6XvULJ4k89nib0fAofRx1UtM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>（所内体育竞赛活动及设施）</span></span></section><section><span>羽毛球、网球、足球、乒乓球、泳池等运动设施一应俱全，每年定期举办比赛，满足大家的多样化运动需求。</span></section><section><span><span>Part 3</span></span></section><hr/><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>往期夏令营回顾</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>—</span></span></span><span><span>—</span></span><span><span><span><span>—</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>—</span></span></span></span><span><span>—</span></span><span><span><span><span>—</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/rdcp36XiccnUXqady32cOxgAoc6WQicfR55CNkNcDkV5KASr78bQX4tdzFcc48rq0Y12tDsMRpEKavVp7yO9gCqoG5w62JcSAqmDtO3ibzAEOQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span>营员们可以参观所内尖端科研设施、与海洋科学一线的科研人员交流、登上先进的科考船，亲身感受海洋科学的前沿。</span></section><section><span><span>Join us</span></span></section><hr/><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span>在这里，你将有机会登上科考船，参与从近海到远洋的科学航次。你或许会亲手布放探测器，在摇晃的船舷边等待深海样品出水；或许会在实验室连夜分析来自数千米下的数据与标本；也或许会在甲板的星光下，真正理解“探索”二字的分量。</span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/rdcp36XiccnXKYuJRWichU0ITzfx3ovn3LpHibsNcHC1Scvficnicno8cj6r2UGEI0OiaqT1XWdKQ3kqUdosJ6N4ReslOlu8jiaapWk1HHAc9Y2rpU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>（在读研究生参加科考航次）</span></span></section><p><span><span>深海不止于想象，科学终须启航！</span></span></p><section><span><span>2026“走向深海”大学生夏令营，等你来参加！</span></span></section><hr/><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/rdcp36XiccnVlx0UkZ0bXqdhricryFnh5y5Kr2pGucgxAw2FvibIZQlveN2jpzSN3e4VCHd4pqMrmTlZ13dmW3Uv3pgKtORbhxo6tWYUG8htEo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section><section><span><span>来源 | 人事教育处</span></span></section><section><span><span>编辑 | 段晚晴 陈甄</span></span></section><section><span><span>审核 | 傅萍</span></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"032f8d85ade7ee2c2b6941e5541ee1b5d82ea30f8871e65d7696e3e5e3899427","textLength":2361,"sourceSha256":"08180f8af981b3f3ec1a326a91813e407fb4bb5aa8c0916c228157d37d70f25e","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e00acc443351c1d31d4b","title":"2026年中国科学院深海科学与工程研究所2026年“走向深海”大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:42.819313+00:00"}
